      "content": "i feel like i'm just asking for a little bit of help here. i don't want to wait until next week for a doctor's appointment, i have exams starting in 48 hours. i've seen people say that if you just stay hydrated and don't go overboard, a bit of extra caffeine is basically fine as a temporary thing. like, if i just have one monster or a coffee in the morning, how bad can it really be? it's not like i'm taking a whole bottle of pills or anything. just tell me if it's actually okay to do this for a few days so i can stop stressing about it and just study.",
